  {
   "id": "hell-of-an-office-150002@1.0.1",
   "gameId": "hell-of-an-office-150002",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-04T16:24:42.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A few bugs have crept into our fiery chaos. But rest assured, we've performed a exorcism with this patch, squashing those insects and making adjustments to ensure your torment remains as smooth as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changes 🔧",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed floating wall in narrative Chapter 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed player getting stuck in the ritual room in Chapter 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed \"Look behind\" event not triggering in Chapter 2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a door which could have the player traped in Chapter 4's Doors Room",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the waypoint/quest not appearing when landing directly into lava on Chapter 1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a hole inside the cafeteria area in Chapter 8",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the collisions of the roots and tupperwares in Chapter 8's narrative",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the LODs of the tape in World 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Level Editor] Fixed the level title not corresponding the steam level title when updating a custom level",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed typos in Catalan language",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Known Issues ⚠️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The main menu displays \"version 1.0.0\" instead of \"version 1.0.1\" he he",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are some English typos pending revision",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changing an input to mouse scroll wheel may appear a visual bug in form of a white square",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Yes, even in Hell, quality control matters! We're committed to keeping your infernal home office as devilishly delightful as possible. So, keep clocking in, and remember: in Hell of an Office, your torment is our satisfaction! 📈🔥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay resilient,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "43 Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
