  {
   "id": "hell-of-an-office-150002@0.3.1",
   "gameId": "hell-of-an-office-150002",
   "displayName": "Patch 0.3.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-05-26T15:05:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With the \"Work From Hell\" update, a few bugs have crept into our fiery chaos. But rest assured, we've performed a exorcism with this patch, squashing those insects and making adjustments to ensure your torment remains as smooth as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changes 🔧",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the first platform Safe Zone of all the levels in Hell 7",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where Wooden Doors opened twice",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tutorial from level 10 loads correctly now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Now Exit Portals have a red colour to distinguish them from entrance ones",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Pencil Spikes from level 68 now have collision",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a typo in the Level Selector",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a typo in the Hook Tutorial",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the Sushi Stapler Skin description",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Known Issues ⚠️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Levels 62 and 64 have lower performances, we’ve done some improvements but we aren’t able to further optimise them",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yes, even in Hell, quality control matters! We're committed to keeping your infernal home office as devilishly delightful as possible. So, keep clocking in, and remember: in Hell of an Office, your torment is our satisfaction! 📈🔥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay resilient,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "43 Studios",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
